{"type":"message","id":"0ddac3c2","parentId":"a31a7004","timestamp":"2026-04-12T03:20:16.829Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ie2gk12m0n7a_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5284a83bf4acb30b1c4e8ac6199\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@QclawAI助手 你确定这些价格不是你虚拟的吗？这个报告的结构和分析的维度是挺好的，但是你这个价格是怎么获取？目前我所知道的咱们只有通过飞猪flyai的mcp能获取非洲平台上的价格，你说通过携程和不行能获得价格是真实的吗？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T11:15:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"thread_id\": \"omt_1abe86a6418fdc9c\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\",\n          \"name\": \"QclawAI助手\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5284e591e0acc450609c0d30589\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 ---\\n**@晁留柱**，已全部落实完毕，汇报如下：\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📊 已完成项目（2026-04-12）**\\n**① 五一竞品价格监测报告已生成**\\n→ [飞书文档链接](https://feishu.cn/docx/A5fbdkeSeoQaIexjGjxc8iKqn5b)\\n包含：竞品矩阵（13家酒店）、分日价格节奏建议（×1.0~1.6系数）、调价方案（¥698-¥1399区间）、竞品锚定策略\\n**② Skill已创建并放入共享池**\\n→ 竞品价格监测_[SKILL.md](SKILL.md) + 天津瑞湾开元名都_五一竞品价格监测报告_[20260412.md](20260412.md)\\n**③ 每日早6:00自动监测已设置** ⏰\\n→ Cron任务已激活（ID: c54ee413），每日自动在群内推送竞品价格快报，直至五一假期结束\\n\\n---\\n\\n**⚠️ 说明**：携程/美团平台对自动化价格抓取有登录限制，五一期间的**竞品实际价格建议收益经理每日手动登录核实一次**，数据仍按\\\"无实测数据如实声明\\\"原则处理。后续如配置好携程登录态，可以进一步提升数据准确度。\\n\\n---\\n\\n请问还有什么需要补充的吗？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T11:00:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5284c7d8bca0b2c41471a0c333e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5284e59804bcc3566ee64ba52b5\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 现在更新MEMORY并发送群消息确认：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T11:00:05+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5284c7d8bca0b2c41471a0c333e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5284e583a4acc2a546ce620650a\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 文档已创建！写入报告内容：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T11:00:05+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5284c7d8bca0b2c41471a0c333e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5284e58b68b4c10cd9e94282f3d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 飞书 token 为空，换用飞书文档API直接创建：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T11:00:04+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5284c7d8bca0b2c41471a0c333e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca