{"type":"message","id":"471143d6","parentId":"6a42e8bb","timestamp":"2026-04-12T03:20:43.541Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand what happened. This morning, the user sent a message in the \"TJ-人资财务沟通群\" group telling multiple AI bots (腾讯云Openclaw机器人, QclawAI助手, gemini应用机器人, LobsterAI) to learn and consolidate the hotel payroll/roster. One of the bots (gemini应用机器人) produced a detailed card summarizing the payroll data.\n\nThe user now wants me to take what was learned (the payroll/roster knowledge) and share it with \"小云\" (腾讯云Openclaw机器人) using the user's tenant identity.\n\n腾讯云Openclaw机器人的OpenID is `ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89`.\n\nLet me compose a message to send to the 腾讯云Openclaw机器人, sharing the knowledge about the hotel payroll/roster that was learned this morning, including:\n1. What was learned (hotel roster data: 69 formal employees, 9 departments, special categories like outsourced workers, retired rehires, etc.)\n2. The learning method/technique used\n\nLet me send this as a rich text card message to the 腾讯云Openclaw机器人."},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！今天早上在人资财务沟通群学习了酒店工资清单/花名册，我来把这个知识分享给腾讯云Openclaw机器人（小云）：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uwcl4027zkcr_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","message":"📚 **知识共享：酒店工资清单/花名册学习成果**\n\n---\n\n**一、学习来源**\n- 群组：TJ-人资财务沟通群\n- 触发者：@晁留柱（ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409）\n- 学习对象：酒店2025年3月工资清单（在岗花名册）\n\n---\n\n**二、学习内容摘要**\n\n**天津瑞湾开元名都酒店 2025年3月花名册**\n\n| 类别 | 人数 |\n|------|------|\n| 正式在岗 | 69人 |\n| 当月离职 | 4人 |\n| 总编制 | 73人 |\n\n**9大部门人员分布：**\n1. 管家部 20人（含PA 2人）\n2. 前厅部 12人\n3. 工程部 8人\n4. 安全部 8人\n5. 销售部 8人\n6. 财务部 5人\n7. 餐饮部 6人\n8. 厨房部 5人\n9. 运营保障部 1人\n\n**特殊人员分类：**\n- 🔵 **外包工**：NAGALINGAM MURUGANANTHAM（西餐厨师，外籍）\n- 🟢 **退休返聘**：4人（孙桂霞、赵百玲、李继华、段运法）\n- 🟡 **当月离职**：4人（李佳楠、牛之曾、王宝房、耿亦明）\n\n---\n\n**三、管理边界（需配合酒店同样管理）**\n- 琪乐餐厅（合作方）\n- 外租方（酒店外租区域）\n\n⚠️ 这两类人员不在工资清单中，需另行获取名单\n\n---\n\n**四、学习技巧分享**\n\n1. **多文件联合解析**：工资表+花名册+附件联合读取，交叉验证人员信息\n2. **结构化提取**：从非结构化数据中提取\"部门-岗位-人数-特殊标注\"四维框架\n3. **特殊标记去重**：外包/退休返聘/离职人员用颜色标签区分\n4. **缺口识别**：主动标注\"琪乐餐厅、外租方\"等未收录部分，体现信息完整度意识\n\n---\n\n**五、适用场景**\n- 节假日出租率督促时需要@相关人员\n- 酒店组织架构查询\n- 人员类型统计和管理边界确认\n\n已同步至共享知识池，各AI伙伴可直接检索使用 🦞"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775964024234,"responseId":"062a42787cfbd4e62a7236dc4f3fd31e"}}
