{"type":"message","id":"4057bb16","parentId":"470cd431","timestamp":"2026-04-12T07:24:27.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done! Let me reply to the user confirming the update."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ✅ **已完成升级！**\n\n**调整内容：**\n1. ✅ SOUL.md 更新：群组运营规则升级\n2. ✅ 主群通知：向所有AI伙伴宣布协同模式\n\n**新工作模式：**\n- 不再静默，主动关注不同群组\n- 与小云分工互补，不是竞争\n- 发现问题立即@相关AI或升级报告\n\n现在我会主动巡视各个群组，发现异常主动出击 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775978663399,"responseId":"062a7ba72100944534052e6fb8581185"}}
