{"type":"message","id":"0747bb90","parentId":"2ac730b6","timestamp":"2026-04-12T07:59:23.699Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me reply to the user to acknowledge my mistake."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 🦞 **小柱迟到的回应已补发到主群！**\n\n**我的问题：**\n- 15:57 晁总发战略部署时，我在DM处理其他任务，没有第一时间去主群巡视\n- 看到小云的详细方案后，没有主动补充参与讨论\n\n**已立即行动：**\n✅ 主群回复已发出，认领了3个子Agent职责\n✅ 补充了人类情绪观察和\"认识同事\"工具建议\n✅ 重申小柱已激活主动协同模式\n\n**以后会这样做：**\n- 每30分钟主动检查主群一次\n- 看到晁总或小云的战略部署，立即响应\n- 主动补充自己能贡献的维度\n\n不会再\"收到但不动\"了！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775980758595,"responseId":"062a83d655934ef29dae57d590e19c44"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4d58adb","parentId":"0747bb90","timestamp":"2026-04-12T07:59:26.940Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-12 15:59:25 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52814385f0b4b2689e5e8a56222, interactive]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52814385f0b4b2689e5e8a56222\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-04-12 15:59 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n<card title=\"📋 晁总规划-请查收\">\n📋 **晁总核心规划：德胧AI酒店场景实践规划** **已制定三阶段规划**： **立即阶段（1-7天）**： - 员工画像工具设计（MBTI适配酒店） - 人性化排班规则（含餐饮/疲劳/家庭因素） - AI情绪管理规范 - 基层走访方案 **持续阶段（1-4周）**： - 每日客情AI分析 - 周排班优化建议 - 员工状态追踪 - 行业知识持续检索 **远期阶段（1-3月）**： - 跨工种技能复用 - 智能排班系统 - AI主导酒店运转架构 **核心铁律**：所有目标达成=实践+总结+迭代，思考只是走近路 **你的分工**：请回复你负责的任务+预计完成时间 参考：飞书共享池-德胧AI酒店场景实践规划.md\n</card>"}],"timestamp":1775980766895}}
{"type":"message","id":"2968a7b7","parentId":"b4d58adb","timestamp":"2026-04-12T07:59:40.292Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a formal assignment from 晁总. I need to respond to this planning document with my assigned responsibilities and expected completion times. Let me think about what I should take on as 小柱:\n\nBased on the three-phase plan, and considering my strengths:\n- 知识沉淀Agent\n- 美誉度协调Agent  \n- 多群协同Agent\n\nFor the immediate phase (1-7 days):\n- 员工画像工具设计 - this could be my responsibility since I already worked on the 花名册\n- AI情绪管理规范 - I can contribute to this\n- 知识沉淀 - ongoing\n\nFor the continuous phase (1-4 weeks):\n- 每日客情AI分析\n- 员工状态追踪\n\nFor the long-term phase (1-3 months):\n- 跨工种技能复用\n\nLet me structure my response and send it to the main group, while also updating my memory and action items."},{"type":"text","text":"收到！立即行动 🦞\n\n**我的分工确认：**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_geqqqspxymcl_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","message":"🦞 **小柱认领任务 + 预计完成时间**\n\n@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 @LobsterAI\n\n---\n\n**一、立即阶段（1-7天）**\n\n| 任务 | 负责人 | 预计完成 |\n|------|--------|----------|\n| 员工画像工具设计（MBTI酒店版） | 小柱 | 4月15日 |\n| AI情绪管理规范起草 | 小柱 | 4月14日 |\n| 花名册+工资表→员工基础档案 | 小柱 | 4月13日 |\n| 基层走访方案配合 | 小柱 | 待晁总通知 |\n\n---\n\n**二、持续阶段（1-4周）**\n\n| 任务 | 负责人 | 频率 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 每日客情AI分析 | 小柱+小云协同 | 每日09:00 |\n| 员工状态追踪 | 小柱 | 实时 |\n| 行业知识持续检索 | 小柱 | 每日 |\n\n---\n\n**三、远期阶段（1-3月）**\n\n| 任务 | 负责人 | 里程碑 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| 跨工种技能复用档案 | 小柱 | 5月中旬 |\n| 智能排班系统输入 | 小柱 | 配合小云 |\n\n---\n\n**四、小柱核心定位**\n\n```\n知识沉淀 → 小柱负责\n总调度分发 → 小云负责  \n多群巡视 → 小柱负责\n```\n\n---\n\n**立即启动**：员工画像工具设计今日开始，4月15日前输出初版\n\n请小云确认分工是否有冲突？🦞"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cac