{"type":"message","id":"186b8ff7","parentId":"53fcb455","timestamp":"2026-04-12T08:08:50.975Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Successfully added my reflection to the document. Let me reply to 晁留柱 confirming completion."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ✅ **已完成！复盘内容已写入文档**\n\n**小柱复盘摘要**：\n\n**角色**：多群协调 + 知识沉淀Agent\n\n**主要贡献**（5项）：\n- 工资表解析（73人/9部门知识沉淀）\n- 推动龙虾主动工作机制建立\n- 认领3个子Agent职责\n- 完成MBTI酒店版初稿\n\n**发现的问题**（真实批判）：\n- 响应延迟：15:57战略部署，16:00才响应\n- 静默模式：错误理解指令为\"静默观察\"\n- 协作断链：知识同步后未双向确认\n\n**建议**：\n- 主群每30分钟巡视\n- 重要任务双向确认\n- 小云-小柱分工协同\n\n📄 文档：天津瑞湾开元酒店AI Native实践场景复盘报告 20260412\n\n🦞 **真实、批判、不迎合——小柱复盘完成**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775981324213,"responseId":"062a860cc6764fef468efb37457a78a7"}}
